  "resolvedFinding": {
    "classification": "stale-read functional acceptance gap, not authorization bypass",
    "priorCommit": "399457f06f6ef51f5e3af868d7361be1a872d1a0",
    "priorBehavior": "Age>45s displayed a warning but did not disable commands when a GET was still pending.",
    "finalBehavior": "All four main command handlers compare current Date.now against last successful workbench read, and six command-button conditions include stale.",
    "wholeInverseToPrior": true
  },
  "checks": [
    "Owner/project/task/machine/workspace/executor/scope/session/goal binding before private current-run projection; optional native identities agree when present.",
    "Only real bound queued/running runs are active execution records. Registered queued tasks without run IDs remain planned; terminal/round-limit/stop-request states are explicit.",
    "Owner-bound last80 SQL read is read-only; signed terminal/resultHash qualifies feedback and judgment, not native process text.",
    "CurrentActivity projection omits thinking, signatures, prompts, tool arguments and unknown stdout; raw execution SSE text is never rendered.",
    "Successful workbench GET alone refreshes readAt; workbench failure preserves old information with warning and disables commands. Auth expiry clears context and closes subscriptions.",
    "Run SSE effect is keyed to bound run, not every cursor; same status and duplicate log IDs do not cause repeated read invalidation. GET remains authoritative; 15-second fallback retained.",
    "Achieved primary action opens revise form. Save sends revise only, preserves version/criteria and does not issue start or authorizeContinuous. Active text remains an unsent draft.",
    "Latest three real interactions, task groups and one primary focus replace duplicate summary cards; complete goals/criteria/history remain folded and accessible.",
    "Five daily development overlay files match reviewed actual bytes. Existing dependency versions, remaining scripts, offline build and proxy changeOrigin behavior remain intact.",
    "Only cluster build label changes outside the author manifests and five development overlay paths."
  ],
